OL,3,AFirst Children's Booker prize reveals
OL,4,Ashortlist - and its child judges
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour children have also been announced
OL,7,Fas new judges after a UK-wide
OL,8,Fcompetition. Twelve-year-old Ibrahim
OL,9,Ffrom Hampshire was one of those picked
OL,10,Ffrom more than 4,000 entrants.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
